--- !u!114 &6435618243715265826
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6435618243715265824}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ef5b8f2e4ed2ca34785f3e0d96ddf5d7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneObjectives: 08000000
  cameraSize: 5
  isIndoors: 0
  contracts:
  - {fileID: 1525410884}
  - {fileID: 1142523290}
  - {fileID: 1876519300}
  enableDialogue: 1
  introScript:
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - -ANA! HEY ADANA!
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Ugh stop yelling.
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Haha sorry about that. You just seemed a bit spaced out again.
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Forget it, what\u2019s the job today?"
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Aww you embarrassed? I can see your heart rate going u-
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "I\u2019m turning this thing off."
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - WAIT WAIT! Ok I apologize for my breach of privacy.
    - "We got our work cut out for us this time that\u2019s for sure. I\u2019ll give
      you a run down of what we\u2019ve got."
    - "Some nice folks from the Theocracy of Arzora gave us some big fish to catch
      this time. We\u2019ve got a total of two bounties."
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Aren\u2019t they the ones who conducted experiments on you for years and aren\u2019t
      they known for being more brutal than any dictatorship?"
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Meh that\u2019s all in the past, plus once you see the prices they\u2019re
      offering I don\u2019t think we\u2019ll have to worry about a bit of brutality."
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - ...
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - My only worry are the targets themselves
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "If they came to us then it can\u2019t be anything I can\u2019t handle."
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "It\u2019s not that I don\u2019t think you can handle it but\u2026 Just see
      for yourself."
    - Z-0 Gluttony mk1 is a new prototype weapon that is being developed for conquering
      the whole of Zugil.
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Wait Zugil-
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "That\u2019s right\u2026 The other bounty is on Andaroz\u2026 Your father\u2026"
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - ...
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - You gonna be ok?
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Ok? OK?!
    - "I\u2019M SHAKING WITH EXCITEMENT!!!"
  - name: Satchel
    rightSide: 1
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcec055340ce8cf448fd9ae7e21d4ff1, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Oh\u2026 Not what I was expecting."
  - name: Adana
    rightSide: 0
    speakerImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 963c17d939b2dc14e942441d2e865176, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Let\u2019s get this show on the road! I can\u2019t wait to crush them!"
  andarozContractScript: []
  trainContractScript: []
  timeLordContractScript: []
